1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,533
You lock your fingers,

2
00:00:01,533 --> 00:00:02,500
push, and

3
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:03,669
CRACK!

4
00:00:03,699 --> 00:00:05,167
No bones were harmed.

5
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:05,779
Your knuckle

6
00:00:05,779 --> 00:00:06,739
just cracked open

7
00:00:06,739 --> 00:00:07,800
a soda.

8
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:08,424
Each knuckle

9
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:09,229
is sealed in

10
00:00:09,229 --> 00:00:10,579
slippery fluid...

11
00:00:10,579 --> 00:00:11,024
full of

12
00:00:11,024 --> 00:00:12,533
dissolved gas.

13
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,904
Stretch it...

14
00:00:13,904 --> 00:00:15,380
the pressure drops...

15
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,261
and POP!

16
00:00:16,261 --> 00:00:17,200
A bubble.

17
00:00:17,228 --> 00:00:18,215
Scientists caught it

18
00:00:18,215 --> 00:00:19,333
in an MRI...

19
00:00:19,559 --> 00:00:21,261
right on the crack.

20
00:00:21,261 --> 00:00:22,467
Subscribe...

21
00:00:22,516 --> 00:00:23,600
one doctor

22
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,030
went too far.

23
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:25,580
He cracked

24
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,302
only his LEFT hand,

25
00:00:27,302 --> 00:00:28,833
for fifty years.

26
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:29,950
Arthritis?

27
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:30,933
Neither hand.

28
00:00:31,382 --> 00:00:32,950
Sorry, Mom.

